		{
			dependencies: ["077AA27F26B7831F"]
			description: [
				"&oNote: this quest accepts a Power Unit of any voltage (LV, MV, HV, EV \\& IV).&r"
				""
				"With &bGregTech &6Power Storage&r unlocked, you can make &aPower Units&r for electric GT tools."
				""
				"Check if that tool has that tier first! &6Drills&r are available at all tiers, the &6Wrench&r is available at &7LV&r, &6HV&r and &9IV&r, and the other electric tools, such as &6Chainsaws&r and &6Screwdrivers&r are only available at &7LV&r. "
				""
				"&2A new addition among them is the Drill, which at LV tier can mine a 3x3x1 area of blocks, and at MV tier can mine a 3x3x3 area of blocks."
				""
				"Higher tier drills can mine 5x5x5, 7x7x7 and 9x9x9 areas! Shift-right-click to change the breaking area.&r"
				""
				"Charge these with a &6Battery&r of appropriate tier, or in an appropriately tiered &3Machine&r, &3Battery Buffer&r or &3Turbo Charger&r. "
				""
				"You may want to look into &6Chainsaws&r for mass tree felling as well, or a &6Wrench&r for breaking machines very quickly. The other electric tools are probably not worth making."
			]
